Package: ggbumpribbon
Title: Sigmoid-Curved Ribbons for Rank Comparison Charts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sondre", "Skarsten", email = "sondreskarsten@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A ggplot2 extension providing sigmoid-curved filled ribbons
    between discrete rank positions. While ggbump provides sigmoid rank
    lines and ggforce provides bezier ribbons, no existing package renders
    sigmoid-curved filled areas positioned at exact rank coordinates. The
    package implements a custom Stat that computes ribbon boundaries via
    logistic interpolation, delegating rendering to ggplot2's built-in
    GeomRibbon.
